"with scroll-anchored features). \"Auto\" forces the offscreen-rendering "
"optimization even when the global default would skip it. \"Hidden\" "
"(advanced) skips rendering entirely while preserving the DOM and element "
"state, similar to a collapsed tab — only use if you know you need it. "
"Explicit values apply everywhere, including Layout Sections."
