msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:278
msgid ""
"Controls how long each tab stays active, in milliseconds. If the tab "
"contents differ a lot in height, set a \"Content Height\" on the design tab "
"to stop the page from jumping on each switch."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:295
#: builder/inc/helpers/class-fusion-builder-background-slider-helper.php:143
msgid "Pause On Hover"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:296
msgid ""
"Choose to pause the rotation while the mouse is over the element. Rotation "
"always pauses while a tab has keyboard focus."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:313
msgid "Resume After Interaction"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:314
msgid ""
"Choose whether rotation continues after a visitor selects a tab themselves. "
"When set to no, rotation stops for good on the first interaction."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:331
msgid "Play / Pause Button"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:332
msgid ""
"Show a play / pause button above the tabs, so visitors can stop the "
"rotation. Recommended as accessibility aid."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:352
msgid ""
"Global setting for all tabs, this can be overridden individually. Click an "
"icon to select, click again to deselect."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:356
msgid ""
"Choose the position of the icon on the tab. Icons can be selected in the "
"general tab for the same icon on all tabs, or in each child item for "
"individual tab icons."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:369
msgid ""
"Set the size of the icon. In pixels, ex: 13px. Icons can be selected in the "
"general tab for the same icon on all tabs, or in each child item for "
"individual tab icons."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:417
