msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:560
msgid ""
"Set to \"Yes\" to fill the tabs with a gradient. It is painted over the "
"background color above, so a gradient using transparency blends into that "
"color."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:571
