msgid ""
"Controls the padding of tabs content, In pixels or percentage, ex: 10px or "
"10%."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:769
msgid ""
"Controls the thickness of the border around the tab list and the content "
"panel, in pixels. The two are one continuous frame on this design, so a "
"single size keeps them aligned. Set to 0 to remove the border."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:788
msgid "Content Border Size"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:789
msgid ""
"Controls the thickness of the border around the content panel. In pixels or "
"em, ex: 1px. This design draws no panel border by default, so anything "
"above 0 adds one. Pairs with the content background color and border radius."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:809
msgid "Content Border Radius"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:810
msgid ""
"Controls the border radius of the content panel, in pixels or percentage, "
"ex: 10px or 10%. On the classic design the active tab runs into the top "
"edge of the panel, so rounding only the bottom corners usually reads best "
"there."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:823
msgid ""
"Controls the background color of the content panel. Leave empty for the "
"default, which is the active tab background color on the classic design, so "
"that panel and active tab read as one surface, and no color at all on the "
"clean design."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:832
msgid ""
"Controls the color of the border around the tab list and the content panel. "
"Set it to transparent to remove those borders, which is often what rounded "
"tabs want."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:840
msgid "Active Tab Accent Border Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:841
msgid ""
"Controls the color of the accent edge on the active tab, which only the "
"classic design draws. The rotation progress indicator falls back to it when "
"no color of its own is set."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:849
msgid "Active Tab Accent Border Size"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:850
msgid ""
"Controls the thickness of the accent border on the active tab, in pixels. "
"When auto rotation is enabled, the progress line is drawn along that same "
"border."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:868
msgid "Rotation Progress Indicator"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:869
msgid ""
"Show a progress indicator on the active tab that fills up before the next "
"tab is shown. The classic design uses a bar on the active tab accent edge, "
"the clean design fills the tab itself."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:887
msgid "Rotation Progress Indicator Style"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:888
msgid ""
"Choose whether the progress fills the background of the active tab, or "
"draws a line along its edge. Default uses a line on the classic design, "
"drawn over the accent edge it already has, and a background fill on the "
"clean design."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:912
msgid "Rotation Progress Line Position"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:913
msgid ""
"Choose which edge of the active tab the progress line runs along. Any edge "
"can be used on either tab layout. Default uses the start edge for vertical "
"tabs and the bottom edge for horizontal ones."
msgstr ""

