msgid "Rotation Progress Indicator Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:951
msgid ""
"Set the color of the rotation progress indicator. Leave empty to derive it "
"from the active tab border color, softened so the progress stays readable "
"against it."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:971
msgid "Rotation Progress Track Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:972
msgid ""
"Set the color of the unfilled part of the progress line. Leave empty to use "
"the border color."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1002
msgid "Rotation Progress Indicator Size"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1003
msgid ""
"Set the thickness of the rotation progress line, in pixels. The classic "
"design draws it along the active tab accent border, so it follows \"Active "
"Border Size\" there."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1038
msgid "Play / Pause Button Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1039
msgid ""
"Set the text and icon color of the play / pause button. Leave empty to use "
