#: builder/elements/tb-woo-product-images/Globals.php:149
msgid ""
"Controls the number of columns of the single product page image gallery "
"thumbnails. In order to avoid blurry thumbnails, make sure the "
"\"WooCommerce Product Images Thumbnails Width\" option above is large "
"enough. It has to be at least \"WooCommerce Product Images Width\" option "
"divided by this number of columns."
