#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/colors.php:82
msgid "Default Color Mode"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/colors.php:83
msgid ""
"Controls which color palette mode the site uses by default. \"Main\" uses "
"only the Main Color Palette with no switching. \"Light\" or \"Dark\" sets "
"the site to that mode's palette for all visitors. \"Auto\" follows the "
"visitor's OS preference, based on the palettes set in \"Light Mode "
"Palette\" and \"Dark Mode Palette\". If a Button element is connected to "
"the \"Color Mode Toggle\" dynamic data endpoint, individual visitors can "
