#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:707
msgid ""
"The site-wide ceiling on how visitors may be identified by tracking "
"features. \"Anonymous\" counts visitors without cookies — they are never "
"recognised on a return visit, no consent banner is required, and A/B "
"testing and statistics still work day-scoped. \"Session Cookies\" allows "
"capped tracking cookies, \"Full\" additionally allows a persistent visitor "
"identifier — both subject to visitor consent when the Privacy Consent Tools "
"are enabled. Storage visitors explicitly ask for (wishlists, comparisons) "
"is not governed by this setting."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:719
msgid ""
"Allow joining a visitor's browsing history to their contact record when "
"they log in, check out or click a campaign email link. This is the switch "
"that turns anonymous statistics into personal data — with it off, contacts "
"are still created for emails and orders, but their browsing history is "
"never attached to them."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:727
msgid "Email Engagement Tracking"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:728
msgid ""
"Record per-recipient open and click counts reported by your email provider. "
"Turn off to stop recording engagement against individual contacts — "
"campaign-level delivery status is kept either way."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:733
msgid "Guest Cookie Lifetime"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:734
msgid ""
"How long guest-scoped cookies (visitor identifier, wishlist and comparison "
"tokens) may live, in days."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:740
msgid "On Consent Revocation"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:741
msgid ""
"What happens to already-collected data when a visitor withdraws consent for "
"a category. \"Anonymise\" removes the link to the visitor but keeps rows "
"for aggregate statistics; \"Delete\" removes them entirely. Features that "
"cannot anonymise meaningfully always delete."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:744
msgid "Stop Collecting"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:745
msgid "Anonymise"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:752
msgid ""
"Retention limits below are enforced by a daily cleanup and are the values "
"shown to visitors in the consent bar. Anonymous (unconsented) visit data is "
"always removed after 24 hours."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:757
