#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:758
msgid "Months to keep visit sessions. 0 keeps them forever."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:764
msgid "Behavioural Event Retention"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:765
msgid ""
"Days to keep behavioural events (page views, scrolling, time on page). "
"Operational records such as cart snapshots follow the session retention "
"instead. 0 keeps them forever."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/privacy.php:771
